n real time, display shields and delayed HP loss, and turn gray when a hero is defeated. The damage statistics screen now displays the total battle duration. UI and Control Improvements During the first chapter-map introductio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T12:39:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4924200-1842846814446369","game_id":"steam-4924200","kind":"update","title":"Void Forge Demo Update V1.0.4","summary":"New Content Added currency-change animations and a button to view the effect list on the event screen. Added a Global Relic preview to the Forge screen. UI and Control Improvements Improved the display of the language dropdown in Settings. Improved the Relic-equipping tutorial. Improved event icons. Improved drag-and-drop interactions in the Relic panel. Added level indicators to hero portraits on the battle deployment screen. Riftbreaker Relic Updates A before-and-after comparison of each adjus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T12:43:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446369","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4924200-1842846814439602","game_id":"steam-4924200","kind":"update","title":"Void Forge Demo Update V1.0.3","summary":"Fixes Fixed an issue where the currency amount displayed on the refresh button in the Forge screen was incorrect. Fixed an issue where stat bonuses from certain Relics were not correctly displayed in the character panel after progressing to the next stage.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T08:25:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439602","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4924200-1842212951304022","game_id":"steam-4924200","kind":"update","title":"Void Forge Demo Update V1.0.2","summary":"New Content Added 6 new random encounters. Added a 2x battle speed option for in-combat use. Added an Event Modifiers entry to the chapter selection screen, where all currently active modifier effects can be reviewed. Battle Preparation Improvements Expanded the Global Relic panel to display the same number of slots as the maximum granted by fully unlocked Talents. Starting battle now automatically closes any open combatant details panel. Added a marker for the currently selected unit to the tea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T18:06:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4924200-1841579228676051","game_id":"steam-4924200","kind":"update","title":"《Void Forge》 Update V1.0.1","summary":"Hello everyone! Here are the update notes for Version 1.0.1:Version: V1.0.1Release Date: August 25, 2026, 00:35 (UTC+8)Bug FixesFixed an issue where sound effect settings changes did not take effect.Thank you all for your continued support and feedback. If you encounter any bugs or other issues affecting your experience, please reach out to us! We will keep fixing problems and improving the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T16:50:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676051","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_stat